# Input
```yaml
# should generate diagnostics
# the tag belongs to the mapping, so the first key is still an unquoted word
!!map
true: 1
---
# the anchor belongs to the first key
!!map
&key false: 2
other: { *key : 3 }
---
# the anchor and the tag belong to the mapping
&root !!bool
name: 4
other: { *root : 5 }
---
# the anchor belongs to the mapping that is a sequence item
- &item
  TRUE: 6

```

